-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium css-1umw9bq-MuiSvgIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="NetworkCheckIcon"><path d="M15.9 5c-.17 0-.32.09-.41.23l-.07.15-5.18 11.65c-.16.29-.26.61-.26.96 0 1.11.9 2.01 2.01 2.01.96 0 1.77-.68 1.96-1.59l.01-.03L16.4 5.5c0-.28-.22-.5-.5-.5M1 9l2 2c2.88-2.88 6.79-4.08 10.53-3.62l1.19-2.68C9.89 3.84 4.74 5.27 1 9m20 2 2-2c-1.64-1.64-3.55-2.82-5.59-3.57l-.53 2.82c1.5.62 2.9 1.53 4.12 2.75m-4 4 2-2c-.8-.8-1.7-1.42-2.66-1.89l-.55 2.92c.42.27.83.59 1.21.97M5 13l2 2c1.13-1.13 2.56-1.79 4.03-2l1.28-2.88c-2.63-.08-5.3.87-7.31 2.88"></path></svg></span>Test connection</button><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-7ctihp-MuiTypography-root">Tests what is on screen, saved or not — so a new bucket can be proved before you commit to it. One small object is written and deleted again.</p></div></form></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`the built-in drivers' forms are unchanged > s3 1`] = `"<div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthLg css-5c1adp-MuiContainer-root"><div class="MuiBox-root css-8f57v9"><h1 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1it4a80-MuiTypography-root">Storage</h1><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-9ebprp-MuiTypography-root">Point this deployment at an object store, prove the credentials work, and create the bucket if it is not there yet.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-1tty75b-MuiTypography-root">Last updated by admin@example.com on 1/1/2026, 12:00:00 AM</p><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 css-15rcfbi-MuiPaper-root" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"><form class="MuiBox-root css-0" novalidate=""><div class="MuiFormControl-root css-1i62zew-MuiFormControl-root"><label class="MuiFormLabel-root MuiFormLabel-colorPrimary css-nwsdb5-MuiFormLabel-root" id="storage-provider-label">Provider</label><div class="MuiFormGroup-root MuiRadioGroup-root css-s7fsp5-MuiFormGroup-root" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="storage-provider-label"><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiRadio-root MuiRadio-colorPrimary PrivateSwitchBase-root MuiRadio-root MuiRadio-colorPrimary Mui-checked MuiRadio-root MuiRadio-colorPrimary css-1q72ply-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiSwitchBase-root-MuiRadio-root"><input class="PrivateSwitchBase-input css-12xagqm-MuiSwitchBase-root" type="radio" value="s3" checked="" name="_r_0_"><span class="css-9oxshb-MuiRadioButtonIcon-root"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium css-iy8fvg-MuiSvgIcon-root-MuiRadioButtonIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="RadioButtonUncheckedIcon"><path d="M12 2C6.4