<div class="MuiFormControl-root MuiFormControl-fullWidth MuiTextField-root css-cmpglg-MuiFormControl-root-MuiTextField-root"><label class="MuiFormLabel-root MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-shrink MuiInputLabel-outlined MuiFormLabel-colorPrimary MuiFormLabel-filled MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-shrink MuiInputLabel-outlined css-113d811-MuiFormLabel-root-MuiInputLabel-root" data-shrink="true" for="_r_1_" id="_r_1_-label">Bucket</label><div class="MuiInputBase-root MuiOutlinedInput-root MuiInputBase-colorPrimary MuiInputBase-fullWidth MuiInputBase-formControl css-1blp12k-MuiInputBase-root-MuiOutlinedInput-root"><input aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="_r_1_-helper-text" id="_r_1_" class="MuiInputBase-input MuiOutlinedInput-input css-16wblaj-MuiInputBase-input-MuiOutlinedInput-input" type="text" value="app-objects"><fieldset aria-hidden="true" class="MuiOutlinedInput-notchedOutline css-18p5xg2-MuiNotchedOutlined-root-MuiOutlinedInput-notchedOutline"><legend class="css-ex8a5f-MuiNotchedOutlined-root"><span>Bucket</span></legend></fieldset></div><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root MuiFormHelperText-sizeMedium MuiFormHelperText-contained MuiFormHelperText-filled css-er619e-MuiFormHelperText-root" id="_r_1_-helper-text">Clearing this un-configures storage for the whole deployment.</p></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 css-13xb3fr-MuiGrid-root"><div class="MuiFormControl-root MuiFormControl-fullWidth MuiTextField-root css-cmpglg-MuiFormControl-root-MuiTextField-root"><label class="MuiFormLabel-root MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-shrink MuiInputLabel-outlined MuiFormLabel-colorPrimary MuiFormLabel-filled MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-shrink MuiInputLabel-outlined css-113d811-MuiFormLabel-root-MuiInputLabel-root" data-shrink="true" for="_r_2_" id="_r_2_-label">Region</label><div class="MuiInputBase-root MuiOutlinedInput-root MuiInputBase-colorPrimary MuiInputBase-fullWidth MuiInputBase-formControl css-1blp12k-MuiInputBase-root-MuiOutlinedInput-root"><input aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="_r_2_-helper-text" id="_r_2_" class="MuiInputBase-input MuiOutlinedInput-input css-16wblaj-MuiInputBase-input-MuiOutlinedInput-input" type="text" value="us-east-1"><fieldset aria-hidden="true" class="MuiOutlinedInput-notchedOutline css-18p5xg2-MuiNotchedOutlined-root-MuiOutlinedInput-notchedOutline"><legend class="css-ex8a5f-MuiNotchedOutlined-root"><span>Region</span></legend></fieldset></div><p class="MuiFormHelperText-root MuiFormHelperText-sizeMedium MuiFormHelperText-contained MuiFormHelperText-filled css-er619e-MuiFormHelperText-root" id="_r_2_-helper-text">The region holding the bucket, e.g. us-east-1.</p></div></div></div><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth css-1ouqunm-MuiDivider-root"><h6 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1wmifpn-MuiTypography-root">Amazon S3</h6><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-7ctihp-MuiTypography-root">No endpoint is needed — the AWS SDK builds one from the region and the bucket.</p><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth css-1ouqunm-MuiDivider-root"><h6 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h6 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1wmifpn-MuiTypography-root">Credentials</h6><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-spacing-xs-2 css-zjhuaj-MuiGrid-root"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-6 css-13xb3fr-MuiGrid-root"><div class="MuiFormControl-root MuiFormControl-fullWidth MuiTextField-root css-cmpglg-MuiFormControl-root-MuiTextField-root"><label class="MuiFormLabel-root MuiInputLabel-root MuiInputLabel-formControl MuiInputLabel-animated MuiInputLabel-shrink MuiInputLabel-outlined MuiFormLabel-color