"off" suppresses the default and is what breaks a MinIO deployment.</p></div><hr class="MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth css-1ouqunm-MuiDivider-root"><div class="MuiBox-root css-lmwmd8"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root Mui-disabled MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary css-74d805-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiButton-root" tabindex="-1" type="submit" disabled="">Save changes</button><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-outlined MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary css-1blvszr-MuiButtonBase-root-MuiButton-root" tabindex="0" type="button"><span class="MuiButton-icon MuiButton-startIcon css-1lxyhll-MuiButton-startIcon"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium css-1umw9bq-MuiSvgIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="NetworkCheckIcon"><path d="M15.9 5c-.17 0-.32.09-.41.23l-.07.15-5.18 11.65c-.16.29-.26.61-.26.96 0 1.11.9 2.01 2.01 2.01.96 0 1.77-.68 1.96-1.59l.01-.03L16.4 5.5c0-.28-.22-.5-.5-.5M1 9l2 2c2.88-2.88 6.79-4.08 10.53-3.62l1.19-2.68C9.89 3.84 4.74 5.27 1 9m20 2 2-2c-1.64-1.64-3.55-2.82-5.59-3.57l-.53 2.82c1.5.62 2.9 1.53 4.12 2.75m-4 4 2-2c-.8-.8-1.7-1.42-2.66-1.89l-.55 2.92c.42.27.83.59 1.21.97M5 13l2 2c1.13-1.13 2.56-1.79 4.03-2l1.28-2.88c-2.63-.08-5.3.87-7.31 2.88"></path></svg></span>Test connection</button><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body2 css-7ctihp-MuiTypography-root">Tests what is on screen, saved or not — so a new bucket can be proved before you commit to it. One small object is written and deleted again.</p></div></form></div></div></div>"`;
